OL,3,GNEWSAMarket street food traders 'sad to
OL,4,Alose home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStreet food traders have said they are
OL,7,F"sad to lose their home" as Manchester
OL,8,FPiccadilly Market prepares to close for
OL,9,Fthe redevelopment of Piccadilly
OL,10,FGardens.
OL,12,FThe market will shut on 22 October as
OL,13,Fpart of Manchester City Council's
OL,14,Fmulti-million-pound revamp.
OL,16,FTraders said they were disappointed to
OL,17,Fleave a site where they had built a
OL,18,Floyal customer base and strong
OL,19,Fcommunity.
OL,21,FThe council said all traders would be
OL,22,Foffered alternative locations.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
